    "synopsis": {
        "native": "C\u2019est dans l\u2019enthousiasme que Sybille de\u0301marre l\u2019e\u0301criture de son premier film. Actrice reconnue, elle va passer pour la premie\u0300re fois de l\u2019autre co\u0302te\u0301 de la came\u0301ra. Tout semble lui sourire. Ses productrices Brigitte et Ingrid sont deux personnages loufoques mais attachantes et Sybille se jette avec elles dans l\u2019aventure, mettant de co\u0302te\u0301 sa vie familiale. Mais, du choix improbable des actrices, aux re\u0301e\u0301critures successives du sce\u0301nario, en passant par les refus des financiers, le re\u0302ve merveilleux va se transformer en cauchemar. Incorrigible optimiste, Sybille re\u0301alisera trop tard que ses productrices fantasques et totalement de\u0301jante\u0301es vont l\u2019entrai\u0302ner dans leur folie...",
        "english": "Sybille enthusiastically launches into writing the screenplay for her first film. A renowned actress, this is the first time she'll be stepping behind the camera to direct. Everything seems favorable to her success. Her producers Brigitte and Ingrid are two crazy but endearing characters and with them Sybille throws herself into this adventure, putting her family life on hold. But, from the improbable casting of the lead actresses to the successive rewrites of the screenplay, and not forgetting a lack of financiers willing to commit, the wonderful dream turns into a nightmare. An incorrigible optimist, Sybille will realize too late that her fanciful and totally insane producers are going to drag her into their madness."
    },
